{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\AdminPage\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-since-above-min",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/ProjectTimelineService.php:59 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isEnabledForAnyone(): there since Nextcloud 32, the app declares from 28",
        "lib/Service/StorageMonitoringService.php:95 OCP\\IContainer::get(): there since Nextcloud 34, the app declares from 28"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 2 files of the public API that the oldest majors of Nextcloud 28 to 34 do not have yet. Either min-version in appinfo/info.xml goes up, or the app does without it there.",
        "  lib/Service/ProjectTimelineService.php:59 OCP\\App\\IAppManager::isEnabledForAnyone(): there since Nextcloud 32, the app declares from 28",
        "  lib/Service/StorageMonitoringService.php:95 OCP\\IContainer::get(): there since Nextcloud 34, the app declares from 28"
      ]
    },
